<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1971405024"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1639294020"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="夏灯篭"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="HACHI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="夏灯篭"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:13.934"><div begin="00:12.129" end="04:13.934"><p begin="00:12.129" end="00:14.262" itunes:key="L1">砂浜はさらり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沙滩一片柔软</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su na ha ma ha sa ra ri</span></p><p begin="00:14.263" end="00:18.104" itunes:key="L2">夜の海は昏々と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜海似是昏沉入梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru no u mi ha ko n ko n to</span></p><p begin="00:18.105" end="00:20.201" itunes:key="L3">波間をすべる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夏日灯火 盏盏灯笼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi ma wo su be ru</span></p><p begin="00:20.202" end="00:24.064" itunes:key="L4">夏燈り 灯篭よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倒映晃动于波浪之间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu a ka ri to u ro u yo</span></p><p begin="00:24.065" end="00:26.252" itunes:key="L5">水平の向こうに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是否终将消失在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su i he i no mu ko u ni</span></p><p begin="00:26.253" end="00:29.363" itunes:key="L6">私は逝くか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">水平线的彼端呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha yu ku ka ?</span></p><p begin="00:29.364" end="00:30.900" itunes:key="L7">貴方はいるか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会不会在那里？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ha i ru ka ?</span></p><p begin="00:30.901" end="00:32.398" itunes:key="L8">チラチラと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">光芒闪闪烁烁燃烧送别的篝火</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ra chi ra to mo yu ru o ku ri bi</span></p><p begin="00:32.399" end="00:36.639" itunes:key="L9">燃ゆる送り火<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">瞥见的是送别的篝火</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ra chi ra to mo yu ru o ku ri bi</span></p><p begin="00:48.181" end="00:50.326" itunes:key="L10">もしもこの命<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi mo ko no i no chi</span></p><p begin="00:50.327" end="00:54.078" itunes:key="L11">明日を迎えられず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已无法迎来明天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a su wo mu ka e ra re zu</span></p><p begin="00:54.079" end="00:56.244" itunes:key="L12">吹き消えるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恍若吹熄的灯火</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ki ki e ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:56.245" end="01:00.135" itunes:key="L13">瞳を瞑るとき<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">待我阖眼之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to mi wo tsu mu ru to ki</span></p><p begin="01:00.136" end="01:02.330" itunes:key="L14">貴方のそばに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是不能待在你的身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no so ba ni i ke na i no na ra</span></p><p begin="01:02.331" end="01:05.298" itunes:key="L15">いけないのなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴你左右</span></p><p begin="01:05.299" end="01:06.889" itunes:key="L16">私はやはり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那我依然</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha ya ha ri</span></p><p begin="01:06.890" end="01:09.423" itunes:key="L17">生きていたいのだと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会为了暂且活下去而竭力挣扎吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki te i ta i no da to a ga ku da ro u</span></p><p begin="01:09.424" end="01:11.849" itunes:key="L18">足掻くだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挣扎着抵抗</span></p><p begin="01:12.223" end="01:17.999" itunes:key="L19">誰もが暗い海の上で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任谁都在这片漆黑的海域</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo ga ku ra i ku ra i ku ra i u mi no u e de</span></p><p begin="01:18.000" end="01:24.005" itunes:key="L20">灯火を抱いて生きていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀揣着一盏灯火而活</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to mo shi bi wo i da i te i ki te i ku</span></p><p begin="01:24.006" end="01:36.564" itunes:key="L21">ゆらめく旅路は美しい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">光芒摇曳的旅途如此美丽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ra me ku ta bi ji ha u tsu ku shi i</span></p><p begin="01:42.137" end="01:44.306" itunes:key="L22">時は流れ行き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时光荏苒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki ha na ga re yu ki</span></p><p begin="01:44.307" end="01:48.081" itunes:key="L23">巡る日々は淡々と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">岁月流转淡然而逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me gu ru hi bi ha ta n ta n to</span></p><p begin="01:48.082" end="01:50.286" itunes:key="L24">夏が来るたびに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当夏日来临时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu ga ku ru ta bi ni</span></p><p begin="01:50.287" end="01:53.992" itunes:key="L25">心はもどかしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中都无比焦急</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ha mo do ka shi i</span></p><p begin="01:53.993" end="01:56.259" itunes:key="L26">線香花火の音<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">线香烟花滋滋响起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se n ko u ha na bi no ne</span></p><p begin="01:56.260" end="01:59.313" itunes:key="L27">火花が散って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">花火四溅开来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ba na ga chi 't te</span></p><p begin="01:59.314" end="02:00.862" itunes:key="L28">燻りながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在一阵烟雾中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku su bu ri na ga ra</span></p><p begin="02:00.863" end="02:02.283" itunes:key="L29">淑やかに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">安安静静地消散于一片孤寂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi to ya ka ni po tsu ri o chi yu ku</span></p><p begin="02:02.284" end="02:08.729" itunes:key="L30">ポツリ落ちゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不经意间凋落了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi to ya ka ni po tsu ri o chi yu ku</span></p><p begin="02:18.225" end="02:20.361" itunes:key="L31">砂浜はさらり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沙滩一片柔软</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su na ha ma ha sa ra ri</span></p><p begin="02:20.362" end="02:23.825" itunes:key="L32">夜の海は昏々と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜海似是昏沉入梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru no u mi ha ko n ko n to</span></p><p begin="02:24.166" end="02:26.241" itunes:key="L33">時は流れ行き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时光荏苒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki ha na ga re yu ki</span></p><p begin="02:26.242" end="02:29.853" itunes:key="L34">巡る日々は淡々と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">岁月流转淡然而逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me gu ru hi bi ha ta n ta n to</span></p><p begin="02:30.122" end="02:32.315" itunes:key="L35">波間をすべる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夏日灯火 盏盏灯笼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi ma wo su be ru</span></p><p begin="02:32.316" end="02:36.117" itunes:key="L36">夏燈り 灯篭よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倒映晃动于波浪之间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu a ka ri to u ro u yo</span></p><p begin="02:36.118" end="02:41.813" itunes:key="L37">どうか果てまで届け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只愿能企及终焉所在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka ha te ma de to do ke</span></p><p begin="02:42.102" end="02:44.345" itunes:key="L38">もしもこの命<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi mo ko no i no chi</span></p><p begin="02:44.346" end="02:48.148" itunes:key="L39">七日の限りなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只剩七天时限</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na no ka no ka gi ri na ra</span></p><p begin="02:48.149" end="02:50.375" itunes:key="L40">声が枯れるまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至声嘶力竭</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e ga ka re ru ma de</span></p><p begin="02:50.376" end="02:54.060" itunes:key="L41">歌を歌いながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都会放声歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ta wo u ta i na ga ra</span></p><p begin="02:54.061" end="02:56.330" itunes:key="L42">何も残せずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只愿不留一物干干净净地离开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni mo no ko se zu ni yu ki ta ku na i to</span></p><p begin="02:56.331" end="02:59.384" itunes:key="L43">逝きたくないと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此逝去</span></p><p begin="02:59.385" end="03:00.910" itunes:key="L44">嘆くだろうか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会为此扼腕吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ge ku da ro u ka</span></p><p begin="03:00.911" end="03:02.316" itunes:key="L45">蝉時雨<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蝉鸣如阵雨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se mi shi gu re</span></p><p begin="03:02.317" end="03:05.919" itunes:key="L46">止まぬ夏空<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不绝于夏日天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ma nu na tsu zo ra</span></p><p begin="03:06.268" end="03:12.164" itunes:key="L47">貴方は暗い海の涯で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你今年也在漆黑的大海尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ha ku ra i ku ra i ku ra i u mi no ha te de</span></p><p begin="03:12.165" end="03:18.090" itunes:key="L48">灯火を今年も待つのでしょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待漂流而去的盏盏灯火吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to mo shi bi wo ko to shi mo ma tsu no de sho u</span></p><p begin="03:18.091" end="03:32.754" itunes:key="L49">道標となれ夏灯篭<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让夏日灯笼化作路标</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi chi shi ru be to na re na tsu to u ro u</span></p><p begin="03:36.153" end="04:13.934" itunes:key="L50">ゆらめく旅路は美しい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">光芒摇曳的旅途如此美丽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ra me ku ta bi ji ha u tsu ku shi i</span></p></div></body></tt>